Description: controls: take part in the system-wide back navigation
 PageRow reports back as available while it has a layer or a page before
 the current one and calls goBack() for the system back control, the
 submenus of GlobalDrawer are left before the drawer is closed, and
 AbstractApplicationWindow and AbstractApplicationItem create the back
 navigation of their window, so that open drawers and dialogs are
 reported also in applications without a PageRow. Applications built
 from these components need no code of their own.
Author: pocket-debs
Forwarded: no
License: LGPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched and new files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-27
